        At VECTRA International, we believe our greatest asset is our people. We are always looking for passionate, driven individuals eager to make an impact and grow their careers with us.
      </p>
      <a class="vh-btn vh-btn--green vh-careers__cta" href="{{ careers_url }}">
        Explore our open roles
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

{% endcase %}
